Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:00:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 01/37] Support CoreDNS 1.14.7 for eks-1-33-34, eks-1-34-25 and
 eks-1-35-16

EKS-D 1-33-34, 1-34-25 and 1-35-16 ship CoreDNS 1.14.7. corefile-migration
v1.0.34, used by CAPI v1.12.11, stops at 1.14.3, so KCP fails to reconcile
CoreDNS. Bump to v1.0.35, which supports 1.14.7. Drop this patch once CAPI
carries v1.0.35.
